{"unit_id":"XUYE23__dsh-page-evidence#card-zh","repo":"XUYE23/dsh-page-evidence","commit":"a7ba913b762e6e0be4fb37fbd2b79b978e30ca5d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Page Evidence（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：逐页读取本地 PDF，帮助检查扫描页漏读并保留可核对的页级引用。它在 DSH 注册 pdf_page_evidence 工具，读取指定文档页，标记文本覆盖不足的页面，并可对低文本页调用本地 CPU OCR。主要功能包括页码选择、逐页文本抽取、OCR 识别、页内关键词匹配和带来源哈希及偏移的引用。适合需要让 DSH 阅读 PDF 并追溯原文页码的用户。使用前配置本机文档目录；OCR 需安装可选依赖，不需要 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin.mjs:7-30","src/core.mjs:8-33","src/pdf-worker.mjs:32-67"]}
{"unit_id":"XUYE23__dsh-page-evidence#card-en","repo":"XUYE23/dsh-page-evidence","commit":"a7ba913b762e6e0be4fb37fbd2b79b978e30ca5d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Page Evidence (DSH Web plugin) reads local PDFs by page, flags low text coverage, and optionally runs CPU OCR. Its tool searches literal terms within a page and returns citations with page numbers and offsets. Configure a local document directory; OCR requires optional packages.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin.mjs:7-30","src/core.mjs:8-33","src/pdf-worker.mjs:32-67"]}
